":true,"expend":true,"reward":false,"firstImg":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/175032a19dd9bf83fe631479.jpeg","rawTitle":"你必须知道：每月为啥只发21.75天工资？关系到加班费、工资扣除的计算！","tagStr":"","longTextForIOS":false,"topic_pic_thumbnail_small":null,"topic_pic_thumbnail":null,"topic_pic_headOrPad":null,"tagsForWeb":";","reply_count":0,"meta_keywords":null,"paid_mention":null,"reward_count":0,"reward_amount":0,"reward_user_count":0,"talk_count":0,"like_count":1,"video_info":null,"quote_cards":null,"promotion_pic":null,"promotion_url":null,"promotion_id":0,"mark_desc":null,"pic_sizes":[{"width":900,"height":383},{"width":1079,"height":938},{"width":1079,"height":967},{"width":600,"height":200}],"cover_pic_size":null,"order_id":0,"tags":[],"status_industry":null,"excellent_comments":[],"notice_tag":null,"common_emotion":null,"current_stock_price":null,"new_card":null,"source_deep_link":null,"source_feed":false,"editable":true,"like_config":null,"title_ad_pic":null,"title_ad_url":null,"title_ad_deep_link":null,"answer_comment":null,"answer_count":0,"answer_users":null,"bonus_screen_name":null,"fundx_tag":null,"extend_st_feed_info":{"stock_event_time":0,"stock_event_type":null,"change_event_color":null,"is_future_event":false,"stock_event_id":null,"stock_event_message":null,"original_text_length":700,"disputed_status":false,"excellent_status":"false"},"stock_list":null,"reply_user_images":null,"reply_user_count":0,"fundx_symbol":null,"hot_new_rank":null,"image_info_list":[{"filename":"175032a19dd9bf83fe631479.jpeg","width":900,"height":383,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"175032a1b9d9c6d3fc7b09ad.jpeg","width":1079,"height":938,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"175032a1d309b763fd8730ca.jpeg","width":1079,"height":967,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"175032a1f719bf93fe7666c1.png","width":600,"height":200,"ocr_result":null}],"extend_st_home_page":{"ip_location":"","st_mention_stock_count":0,"ai_card":null,"ai_status":false,"speech_enable":false,"speech_info":null},"censor_state":0,"pic":"https://xqimg.imedao.com/175032a19dd9bf83fe631479.jpeg,https://xqimg.imedao.com/175032a1b9d9c6d3fc7b09ad.jpeg,https://xqimg.imedao.com/175032a1d309b763fd8730ca.jpeg,https://xqimg.imedao.com/175032a1f719bf93fe7666c1.png","recommend_cards":null,"vod_info":null,"forbidden_retweet":false,"is_answer":false,"is_refused":false,"text":"<p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/175032a19dd9bf83fe631479.jpeg\" /></p> <p>一个月30天，除去四个周六和周日，每月的工作日应该是22天。如果赶上31天的月份，工作日可能会更多。那你每个月计发工资的工作日是按实际工作的天数来计算的吗？</p> <p>现在告诉你：不是！</p> <p>对大多数人来说，月计薪天数是21.75天而不是22天或23天。这是为什么呢？</p> <p><b> 月薪天数这样算 </b></p> <p>根据《全国年节及纪念日放假办法》（国务院令第513号）的规定，一年法定节假日为11天。又根据人力资源和社会保障部《关于职工全年月平均工作时间和工资折算问题的通知》规定，月计薪日为法定节假日的，用人单位应当依法支付工资，因此104个休息日之外的天数都算作年计薪日。</p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/175032a1b9d9c6d3fc7b09ad.jpeg\" /></p> <p>月计薪天数＝（365天-104天）÷12个月＝21.75天。</p> <p>  月计薪天数关系到加班费   </p> <p>按照《劳动法》相关规定，劳动者在法定休假日和婚丧假期间以及依法参加社会活动期间，用人单位应当依法支付工资。</p> <p>依据《工资支付暂行规定》，用人单位安排劳动者在休息日或节假日加班的，应当支付双倍或三倍工资。这时候月计薪天数的作用就显现出来了。</p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/175032a1d309b763fd8730ca.jpeg\" /></p> <p> 月计薪天数关系到工资扣除 </p> <p>根据《关于职工全年月平均工作时间和工资折算问题的通知》的规定，请事假应按月平均计薪天数21.75天来折算扣除工资。</p> <p>员工的日工资为：月工资÷21.75</p> <p>员工应被扣除的工资为：日工资×请假天数</p> <p>员工当月应当领取的工资为：月工资—被扣除工资</p> <p>用精炼的语言阐述深刻的财务逻辑，如文章得到您的认可，<b>希望您看完后分享到“朋友圈”或者点一下右下角的“在看”</b>，以示鼓励。长期坚持原创不易，多次想放弃，坚持是一种信仰，专注是一种态度 ，一路陪伴，一起地老天荒，谢谢。</p> <p>来源：工人日报</p> <p><b>推荐阅读</b></p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/175032a1f719bf93fe7666c1.png\" /></p>","show_cover_pic":true,"legal_user_visible":false,"is_column":false,"is_ss_multi_pic":false,"is_bonus":false,"cover_pic":"","answer_question":false,"is_no_archive":false,"is_original_declare":false,"mp_not_show_status":false,"forbidden_comment":false,"is_private":false}